        <definition>void ndxlPrintError</definition>
        <argsstring>()</argsstring>
        <name>ndxlPrintError</name>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Prints the most recent error code and message in an easily readable format. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>Returns nothing.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>NDXL first attempts to write the error to stderr, and falls back to stdout if that fails. If writing to stdout also fails, the function does nothing. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
